    "content": "<p>Attention, Pilots! The following hotfix will be deployed for War Robots: Frontiers following a short period of maintenance on<strong> April 30, 2025.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Shocktrain (Weapon)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Fixed a bug where the weapon was not affected by damage fall-off over distance. The projectile now correctly deals more damage the closer you are to the target.</li>\r\n\t<li>Fixed a bug where the weapon&rsquo;s projectile would chain off the ground or allies.</li>\r\n\t<li>Fixed a bug where the first two targets of the weapon received the same amount of damage. The damage for subsequent targets will now be correctly reduced after hitting the first target.</li>\r\n</ul>",
